This is made possible via a major mapping service's Location Sharing feature. What's happening here is that this bot has a list of e-mail addresses it adds to its contacts list. It then sends a Location Sharing Request, where you ask another user to share their location with you.

&nbsp;

Here's the manual steps to do this

